Copyright (c) 2026 troskater

This project is a port of FlowDeck, an OpenCode plugin by Dang Van Nghiem
(https://github.com/DVNghiem/FlowDeck), used under the MIT License.

Taken from upstream, with edits where noted:
- skills/            30 of upstream's 42 skills, copied unchanged
- rules/             upstream's rules, minus the OpenCode-specific agent-orchestration rule
- commands/ agents/  rewritten for Claude Code from upstream's command and agent prompts

Not taken: upstream's Rust fdx CLI. This port uses Claude Code's own tools instead.

Written for this port: hooks/, tests/, and the plugin and marketplace manifests.

The upstream copyright and license text are kept in LICENSE.
